{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05729","headline":"题武陵草堂 · 杨浚","name":"题武陵草堂","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"草堂列仙楼，上在青山顶。\n户外窥数峯，阶前对双井。\n雨来花尽湿，风度松初冷。\n登栈行不疲，入谿语弥静。\n云能去尘服，兼欲事金鼎。\n正直心所存，谄谀长自省。\n适知幽遁趣，已觉烦虑屏。\n更爱云林间，吾将卧南颍。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨浚","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05729.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05729","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}